Package: pulsaros-airpods
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Victor Rosario <hello@victorrosario.dev>
Depends: python3, python3-dbus, python3-gi, bluez, gnome-shell
Description: AirPods battery and state in the GNOME top bar for Pulsar OS.
 Shows an AirPods icon in the top bar while AirPods are connected, like macOS,
 with left/right/case battery, in-ear state, a popup when the case opens, and
 pause/resume of media players when the earbuds are removed. A background
 daemon reads Apple Continuity advertisements through BlueZ; a GNOME Shell
 extension (airpods@pulsaros.org) renders them. Supports GNOME Shell 48 and 51.
